{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAt the start of the game, players are automatically dealt 5 attacking and defending cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAttacker cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Lions (attack power 2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Zebras (attack power 1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Cat (attack power 0)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDefender cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tranquilizer gun (defense 2) CT (cooldown) 2 turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rope (defense 1) CT (cooldown) 1 turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bare hands (defense 0) No CT (cooldown)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bOnce an attacker card has been used, it cannot be used again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCT (cooldown) means that once a card has been used, the same defensive card cannot be used for that turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWhen the game starts, the attacker or defender will be decided at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe attacker and defender each place one card from their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe cards are revealed at the same time, and the attack power and defense power values at that time are compared, and the defender takes damage equal to the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAfter three turns, the attacking and defending sides switch roles, and the players then set and reveal cards and deal damage in the same way until a winner is decided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player with the most life wins when they have depleted their opponent's life or run out of cards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834930?t=1753706292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834930?t=1753706292","capsule_image":"https://s