ing and defending sides switch roles, and the players then set and reveal cards and deal damage in the same way until a winner is decided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player with the most life wins when they have depleted their opponent's life or run out of cards.</p>","developers":["\u96fb\u8133\u904a\u622f\u6700\u9ad8\u4f1a\u8b70"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834930/bde0d151e0b41d66708089477c0e060bfd96964b/header.jpg?t=1753706292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3834930/1794235657/dc9c0603926189927dcf503f31d23d4e65a5625d/1751259154/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753610081","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3834930/1794235657/dc9c0603926189927dcf503f31d23d4e65a5625d/1751259154/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753610081","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3834930/1794235657/dc9c0603926189927dcf503f31d23d4e65a5625d/1751259154/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753610081","id":257163294,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163294/movie480.mp4?t=1753610081","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163294/movie_max.mp4?t=1753610081"},"name":"Play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163294/7148a77f9dc113296b3276c30260875366d9f237/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753610081","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163294/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753610081","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163294/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753610081"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3834930/63539368/2b6d904cbeac477dfe970aa70d9c8f5c46bb6427/1753683175/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753683948","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3834930/63539368/2b6d904cbeac477d